 leaf rather than four disconnected assertions. No existing leaf was supplied to reuse (graph structure is empty), so this is a genuine mint, homed under the newly minted Proof strata since the theme is squarely about proving operational reliability through rehearsal.","consulted":[]}],"unplaced":[]},"live_run_id":"1c32efcc8ae6","at":"2026-07-16T23:49:07Z"}
